WEBVTT

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:35.540
Rain?

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:37.930
It's coming down.

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.780
That's why you called?

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:43.320
I wanted... to hear your voice.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:47.160
It's odd that you'd say such a thing.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.270
What's wrong? Something happened?

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.830
Honey, take me to an
amusement park sometime.

00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:00.630
I wanna go at least once to
someplace fun with you.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:02.240
Are you listening?

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:06.380
Ryuji?

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:08.940
Are you there?

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:11.520
Ryuji!

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:13.350
Ryuji!

00:01:25.570 --> 00:01:26.400
Ryuji?

00:01:29.770 --> 00:01:30.530
What's wrong?!

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:31.470
Ryuji?!

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:32.440
Ryuji!!

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:33.400
Ryuji!!!

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:15.050
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:19.110
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:25.050
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:26.060 --> 00:02:32.830
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:36.700
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:43.410
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:48.740
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:53.380
No one knows her true face.

00:03:41.170 --> 00:03:42.300
Where's this?

00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:45.970
You have escaped death.

00:03:46.840 --> 00:03:48.000
I was saved?

00:03:57.450 --> 00:03:58.750
That is your face.

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:01.430
I performed psychic surgery.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:04.350
You have been reborn.

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.360
Who asked you to do that?

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.690
You should be grateful to me.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.970
But you'll soon realize that.

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:06.320
Yoko!

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:15.670
Ryuji called me.

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:21.100
Before he fired the gun... he called me.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:22.760
I see.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:27.500
Ryuji wasn't a good man,
but he was nice to me.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:31.410
I was a newcomer from the countryside
and he was nice to me.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:33.940
I'm sorry.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:36.110
Telling all this to
someone I just met.

00:05:37.290 --> 00:05:38.380
It's okay.

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:41.140
I needed to talk with somebody.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:43.720
I couldn't stand being alone.

00:05:44.160 --> 00:05:46.150
I was the one who called to you.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.490
Your watch...

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:52.410
You have the same watch as Ryuji.

00:05:57.810 --> 00:06:00.540
Just seeing your watch...
makes me miss him.

00:06:02.640 --> 00:06:04.370
Ryuji died meaninglessly.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:05.740
Meaninglessly?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.810
I heard his target knew
he was coming to get them.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.150
The detective told me that
the information had been leaked.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:18.290
He said they were trying to end the
gang rivalry by giving up Ryuji's life.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.660
The boss, whom he loved, betrayed him.

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:27.660
At Ryuji's funeral,
that boss was even laughing.

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:30.360
Showing his gold teeth.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.960
I can't forgive... that bastard!

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:36.900
I want to kill him!

00:06:59.740 --> 00:07:00.610
Boss...

00:07:09.240 --> 00:07:11.010
Another one dead.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.850
It doesn't matter... who dies.

00:07:15.150 --> 00:07:17.880
Come on, let's leave this town.

00:07:18.020 --> 00:07:20.850
Like everything... that's
up to how Miyu feels.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.420
It seems we'll have to observe
that stray Shinma's mischief...

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:26.730
for a little while longer.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.910
I thought I'd see you again.

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:48.750
Are you still in love with that guy?

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:53.350
I have a feeling
he's still alive somewhere.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.080
He had a funeral, right?

00:07:56.630 --> 00:07:58.430
His body was never found.

00:07:59.030 --> 00:08:01.430
There was blood at the scene...

00:08:02.030 --> 00:08:05.730
and people said he was probably
dumped into Tokyo Bay or something.

00:08:06.770 --> 00:08:09.200
I won't be able
to forget for some time.

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:11.830
I'm tired of this life.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:13.570
I want to be reborn.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:17.610
Hey, if you could be reborn,
what would you want to be?

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.440
That's...

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.210
Probably nothing would change.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.920
You haven't told me your name yet.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:27.360
Kenji.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:28.180
Kenji?

00:08:29.120 --> 00:08:30.520
What are you?

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:31.960
Nothing at all.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:34.260
Nothing...

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.460
Did something bad happen to you?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.490
You can change your life.

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:44.900
If you give it your best,
you can always change your life.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:51.540
Next time...

00:08:53.150 --> 00:08:54.980
Why don't we go
to an amusement park?

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:56.910
We should go sometime.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:58.280
Some place fun like that.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:32.640
Forget about that guy.

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.030
He's dead now.

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:59.770
Kenji, you got a new life.

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:17.800
Yoko?

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.390
How... did I get here?

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:29.530
On to our next story.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.420
Yesterday before dawn...

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:34.900
a homicide occurred on the
fourth block of the Takara district.

00:10:35.920 --> 00:10:38.580
The victim was related
to organized crime.

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:40.410
According to a police spokesman...

00:10:40.720 --> 00:10:44.420
it was most likely the action
of a rival crime organization.

00:10:45.090 --> 00:10:48.650
One of victim's ears was
cut off with a sharp knife...

00:10:57.840 --> 00:10:58.770
Hello.

00:10:58.870 --> 00:10:59.640
Hello.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:03.200
What happened?!
All of a sudden you disappeared!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:07.410
Last night... I stayed over
at your house, right?!

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:11.080
I was worried you
wouldn't come back.

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:13.780
How the hell did I get here?!

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:15.850
Don't ever leave me.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.720
Don't ever leave me alone again!

00:11:18.530 --> 00:11:21.220
How the hell did I get here!!!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.900
The victim was strangled, chief.

00:11:29.070 --> 00:11:31.270
There's a mark his throat was wrung.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.240
His necktie was missing,
so it might have been used.

00:11:34.280 --> 00:11:37.040
Hmmm. Were any articles left behind?

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.530
Where am I?

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:12.210
Wh... what the hell?

00:12:12.950 --> 00:12:14.510
What the hell is this?!

00:12:20.890 --> 00:12:23.720
There has been a string of
murders in the Takara district.

00:12:24.160 --> 00:12:26.490
And today, another body
was found in the same area.

00:12:26.860 --> 00:12:29.130
The victim was 17 year old,
Yuki Kanazawa...

00:12:29.230 --> 00:12:31.700
a junior at Takara High School.

00:12:32.170 --> 00:12:34.460
She failed to returned
home last night...

00:12:34.540 --> 00:12:37.000
and the family appealed
to the police for a search.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.920
Come on, what's wrong?

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:56.920
Did something happen?

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.150
I'll kill you...

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.320
Huh?

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.060
Someday... I'll end up killing
you without knowing it!

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.500
I'll end up killing you!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.160
Can't you sleep?

00:13:36.300 --> 00:13:37.820
I don't want to sleep.

00:13:38.900 --> 00:13:40.060
Oh, tell me.

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.800
Don't suffer by yourself.

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:48.910
I don't know a single
thing about you.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.200
Why in the world?

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:52.380
Huh?

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.210
A decent woman like you would
go with a guy like that man?

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:59.080
Thinking about Ryuji bothers you?

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:00.690
No.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:04.920
If I tell you about me,
would you tell me about yourself?

00:14:05.790 --> 00:14:09.190
When I was a child,
my parents abused me.

00:14:10.100 --> 00:14:11.090
Trauma...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:13.660
So I'm only attracted to strong men.

00:14:15.100 --> 00:14:19.940
And... I feel I would protect
the guy no matter what it takes.

00:14:23.450 --> 00:14:26.080
Sometimes I would
be afraid of myself.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.610
This is the first time
I've talked about it.

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.820
Not very happy, is it?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:36.850
There're so many people in this town,
not a decent one in the lot.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.130
You're right.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:42.400
Now, tell me, it's your turn.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.700
You haven't slept
in a while, have you?

00:14:56.180 --> 00:14:57.700
Sleep well.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.810
I will protect you no matter what.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:20.930
We meet at last...

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.170
Huh?

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:52.300
Have you come to thank me?

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.130
Huh?

00:15:58.370 --> 00:16:00.100
What the hell is going on?

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.750
You've become a hero in this town.

00:16:04.450 --> 00:16:07.810
The one who cleans up
the filth in this town.

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:10.450
Did I... did I really kill them?!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:12.220
Your face.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:15.280
Your new face has made you do that.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:20.220
Many people are happy with that.
Well, don't you feel great?

00:16:20.900 --> 00:16:24.670
What did you do to me?!
What in the world are you?!

00:16:36.010 --> 00:16:38.480
You really like
doing pranks, don't you?

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.280
And you are?

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:44.490
I'm not concerned about
how many people die.

00:16:45.320 --> 00:16:47.550
But I cannot disregard stray Shinma.

00:16:48.090 --> 00:16:48.990
I see.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:51.850
So you're the Guardian

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:07.300
OH-SHU

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:20.320
Let the Guardian in this town die...

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.990
as another one of these
depraved humans.

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.990
Shinma, to the Dark!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:42.310
Miyu!

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.490
You were careless yet again, Miyu.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:00.990
For a Guardian,
you really are pathetic.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:25.150
You cannot use them
in that condition.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:26.550
Frozen solid, aren't they?

00:18:36.430 --> 00:18:37.450
Reiha!

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:12.960
Miyu just saved
your life, didn't she?

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:15.560
It's not as though we had asked.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.140
Mind your own business!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.360
We'd have beaten the
Shinma without your help.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.600
We rather you didn't sneak
up and steal the prey.

00:19:22.840 --> 00:19:24.140
What a sore loser!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:27.710
You... you saved me, didn't you?

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:31.610
I only did what I had to do.

00:19:31.950 --> 00:19:34.050
Will it be all right to
just leave him like this?

00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:37.190
If he tells of the existence
of Guardians, there'll be trouble.

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:38.760
Shouldn't we silence him?

00:19:39.030 --> 00:19:42.360
Or perhaps you'll show him
your eternity of dreams.

00:19:44.730 --> 00:19:47.060
W... What is this?!

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:52.130
Didn't you just save my life?!

00:19:55.510 --> 00:19:57.940
It can't be! Not me, too?!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.100
Was it a dream?

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:36.570
Yoko, what's wrong?

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:40.850
Yoko!

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:48.330
I'm...

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.500
But why?

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.260
Stay away!!

00:20:56.900 --> 00:20:57.800
Yoko!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:20:59.760
You've got it wrong!
I'm not!

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:03.440
I'll explain everything!

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:05.680
I can't live without you!

00:21:15.190 --> 00:21:17.120
I'm in love with someone else!

00:21:18.030 --> 00:21:20.190
You being alive is a problem!

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:24.140
I'm... I'm gonna protect him!

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:28.330
Yo... ko...

00:22:10.950 --> 00:22:16.620
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:23.160
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:23.860 --> 00:22:29.730
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:33.300 --> 00:22:37.360
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:37.710 --> 00:22:42.080
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:45.770
I don't need friends.

00:22:45.810 --> 00:22:46.840
That's a lie.

00:22:46.910 --> 00:22:50.010
I don't even need myself.

00:22:50.050 --> 00:22:51.040
It's the truth.

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:58.980
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:02.630 --> 00:23:06.930
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:07.100 --> 00:23:14.230
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:17.910 --> 00:23:23.820
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:24.620 --> 00:23:30.580
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:03.950 --> 00:25:06.040
The first person to attract the boy...

00:25:06.090 --> 00:25:07.710
who had previously
only opened up to cats...

00:25:07.790 --> 00:25:09.310
was a women who loved flowers.

00:25:09.890 --> 00:25:11.950
He couldn't tell anyone
about the mistake.

00:25:12.390 --> 00:25:14.520
For we all long for a friend.

00:25:15.130 --> 00:25:18.360
If only that woman
had not been a Shinma...

00:25:18.630 --> 00:25:20.960
he might have attained happiness.

00:25:22.040 --> 00:25:26.300
Next time, Vampire Princess Miyu
"The Garden Where Reeds Cry".

00:25:27.040 --> 00:25:30.840
Beautiful flowers bloom,
stealing souls.
